# Data
#  - raw/  : the public BPIC2017 log (download separately, do not redistribute here)
#  - processed/ : large derived files, regenerated by prepare_data.py
#  - results/ (small metric CSVs) IS tracked, so figures can be reproduced directly
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep

